## Context

Child of tracker `0648`. `R15-model-cache-under-declared-roots` infers that
weights were exercised from a non-null model reported by status. It can pass
without proving query success, a download during this run, or that the files it
observed are model weights. Its current red is a generic install-time stray,
not a misplaced model download.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] establish a cold-cache precondition
- [ ] prove the retrieval request succeeded and triggered a model download
- [ ] identify the newly materialized weights without target vocabulary leaking
      into the assertion layer
- [ ] return `not-run` or an explicit non-applicable state when no download was
      observed, never `pass`
- [ ] add a discriminating control that downloads weights outside every declared
      root while creating no unrelated residue
- [ ] `make check` passes
